    "start": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Annabelle",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "left",
            "text": "Allez, au turbin! So, I need some help building this shelf to stock all the different guitars, basses, and everything they need on stage.",
            "audio": "s2r031.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_1"
    },
    "line_1": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Annabelle",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "left",
            "text": "Pass me the screwdriver?",
            "audio": "s2r032.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_2"
    },
    "line_2": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Annabelle",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "right",
            "text": "[i]You pass the screwdriver. As she sits down, you notice a slight flinch.[/i]",
            "audio": null
        },
        "next": "line_3"
    },
    "line_3": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Annabelle",
            "mood": "concerned",
            "focus": true
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "left",
            "text": "You know, the boss, I mean…",
            "audio": "s2r034.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_4"
    },
    "line_4": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Annabelle",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "left",
            "text": "No, other screwdriver. The one with yellow tape.",
            "audio": "s2r035.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_5"
    },
    "line_5": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Annabelle",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "right",
            "text": "[i]You sit there, amazed watching her work. She clearly knows what she’s doing, and has done it many times before.[/i]",
            "audio": null
        },
        "next": "line_6"
    },
    "line_6": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Annabelle",
            "mood": "concerned",
            "focus": true
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "left",
            "text": "Yeah… He doesn’t mean harm on us, the boss. It’s just… how it is. You know?",
            "audio": "s2r037.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_7"
    },
    "line_7": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Annabelle",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "right",
            "text": "[i]She keeps working. She flinches again, putting some weight to tighten the last screw.[/i]",
            "audio": null
        },
        "next": "line_8"
    },
    "line_8": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Annabelle",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "left",
            "text": "Back in the day, surely, it was different. Look…",
            "audio": "s2r039.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_9"
    },
    "line_9": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Annabelle",
            "mood": "concerned",
            "focus": true
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "left",
            "text": "I would lie if I said things have always been this way. I remember when we were at the Pile de Bois festival. Sure, it was stressful, but there wasn’t…",
            "audio": "s2r040.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_10"
    },
    "line_10": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Annabelle",
            "mood": "concerned",
            "focus": true
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "left",
            "text": "All this money involved. I feel like there’s juste more and more pressure.",
            "audio": "s2r041.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_11"
    },
    "line_11": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Annabelle",
            "mood": "concerned",
            "focus": true
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "left",
            "text": "I’m close to retirement anyways, and you know… Show must go on. But…",
            "audio": "s2r042.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_12"
    },
    "line_12": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Annabelle",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "right",
            "text": "[i]She pauses. She seems like she’s hesitating to say something.[/i]",
            "audio": null
        },
        "next": "line_13"
    },
    "line_13": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Annabelle",
            "mood": "concerned",
            "focus": true
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "left",
            "text": "I’m just worried. For the kids, you know Sarah, Fred, yourself. I just don’t recognize the job that I started doing 40-so years ago.",
            "audio": "s2r044.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_14"
    },
    "line_14": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Annabelle",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "right",
            "text": "[i]She looks sad. Nostalgic.[/i]",
            "audio": null
        },
        "next": "line_15"
    },
    "line_15": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Annabelle",
            "mood": "warm",
            "focus": true
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "left",
            "text": "Hey, why do you look at me like that? Do I look that old? [i]She laughs. [/i]Although,I could be your mom!",
            "audio": "s2r046.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_16"
    },
    "line_16": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Annabelle",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "right",
            "text": "[i]She stands back up with a grunt, the shelf finished.[/i]",
            "audio": null
        },
        "next": "line_17"
    },
    "line_17": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Annabelle",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "left",
            "text": "[i]Ooffffff.[/i] Ok, my back is acting up. Now you organize this. I’ll guide you through it.",
            "audio": "s2r048.mp3"
        },
        "next": "puzzle1"
    },
    "puzzle1": {
        "type": "puzzle",
        "chara": "Annabelle",
        "next": "line_18"
    },
    "line_18": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Annabelle",
            "mood": "warm",
            "focus": true
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "left",
            "text": "Thanks a lot. Learn by doing! C’est en forgeant qu’on devient forgeron.",
            "audio": "s2r049.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_19"
    },
    "line_19": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Annabelle",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "right",
            "text": "Thanks for guiding me.",
            "audio": null
        },
        "next": "line_20"
    },
    "line_20": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Annabelle",
            "mood": "warm",
            "focus": true
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "left",
            "text": "No problem.",
            "audio": "s2r051.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_21"
    },
    "line_21": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Annabelle",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "left",
            "text": "Anyways, you better hurry up now, Fred is waiting for you.",
            "audio": "s2r052.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_22"
    },
    "line_22": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Annabelle",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "right",
            "text": "[i]You make a face. You seem scared by the idea of working with him.[/i]",
            "audio": null
        },
        "next": "line_23"
    },
    "line_23": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Annabelle",
            "mood": "warm",
            "focus": true
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "left",
            "text": "Tranquille, chill out! Fred is a nice guy once you get to know him. He just doesn’t have a way with words.",
            "audio": "s2r054.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_24"
    },
    "line_24": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Annabelle",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "right",
            "text": "[i]She glances at him. [/i]",
            "audio": null
        },
        "next": "line_25"
    },
    "line_25": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Annabelle",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "left",
            "text": "He has a way with cables.",
            "audio": "s2r056.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_26"
    },
    "line_26": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Annabelle",
            "mood": "concerned",
            "focus": true
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "left",
            "text": "Hey, don’t tell the others what I told you, okay? I don’t want to worry them even more. They’ve got enough on their plates already.",
            "audio": "s2r057.mp3"
        },
        "next": "end"
    }
}
